  "details": "Since yesterday (18. Sept.) the FX layer seems not to be respected anymore during calibration. I use avatar encryption and in the FX layer, all required keys will be set.\nThis first images shows the normal state. FX layer 1.0 / TPOSE layer 0.0. All my BitKeys are set correctly. I appear right in the mirror and my hands looks good:\nThis second image shows the state during calibration. FX layer 1.0 / TPOSE layer 1.0. All my BitKey are set correctly. I appear right in the mirror, but my own instance will not be decrypted anymore (visible mesh spikes in the image).\nI haven't uploadad my avatar. The behavior changed yesterday.",
